  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.4.0: API parity with the Java and JavaScript implementations (OneOrMore, ZeroOrMore, AtLeast, Count, Multiple with counts, OneOf, BeginGroup/EndGroup, Add(VerbalExpressions), Not, SearchOneLine, TestExact, Replace(input, replacement), WordChar, NonWordChar, NonDigit, Whitespace, NonWhitespace, Space, NonSpace). XML documentation for IntelliSense. Fixes: Tab() now matches a real tab character, SomethingBut() no longer throws on '{' or '}', CommonRegex.Url no longer contains invisible characters, AnyOf()/AnythingBut()/SomethingBut() now escape ']', TestExact() no longer throws on a trailing # comment in IgnorePatternWhitespace mode. Test project and CI moved to .NET 10; the library still targets netstandard2.0.",
